// Project `platform-wake`: no project variables on purpose.
// A Deploy a Release step can pass variables that override the child's variables, and the parent processes
// belong to apps (multi-app directive §10). The deployment process therefore reads no project variable and no
// Octopus variable expression; Platform.OctopusApiKey comes from library variable set WorkOrders Platform
// Automation (octopus/terraform), and the Octopus URL and space are written in the script.
